{{!-- A rolled Sanity loss (helpers/sanity.mjs rollSanityLoss): "Shoot: Sanity Lost (Failure)", what it took, and notes
      (Big Failure, mental solidification). losses: the HTML of sanityLossHTML. --}}
{{lotmLang "LORD_OF_THE_MYSTERIES.Sanity.LossFlavor" title=title result=result}}
<div class="lotm chat-sanity">
  {{lotmHTML losses}}
